DESCRIPTION=PRE 4.2.0 first-principles multi-device server and WLAN: net_iface in-tree netdev/FIB view; route-aware fl_net_sock_native (opt-in FL_NET_SOCK_NATIVE=1); Linux P4 Wi-Fi driver backend (wpa_supplicant/wpa_cli) for real scan/join on FL_NET_WIFI_IFACE with optional BSSID pin (wifi join -b aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff); lab MLME/WPA fallback; net_wifi_netdev registers real DHCP IPv4 after association; server interfaces/host -all; tests/test_p3_server_lan.

